# Offline demo (deployment.md §0.1): minimal reverse proxy in front of the app, like Caddy
# in production (§5.2). Its only job: the app is never reached directly, and Caddy
# replaces any client-sent X-Forwarded-For with the real peer address (it trusts no
# upstream proxies), so the auth rate limit cannot be bypassed with forged headers (R-005).
{
	admin off
	auto_https off
}

:3000 {
	reverse_proxy app:3000
}
